  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Combine hamachi, onion, scallion, cucumber, avocado, chile, lemon zest, sesame seeds, soy sauce, and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season with a small pinch of kosher salt and gently fold to combine. Taste and adjust with more soy sauce, olive oil, or salt as desired. Let stand 5 minutes at room temperature, then serve on its own or on top of steamed rice.",
